{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"736679166262509618","content":"As the final words are spoken, Lilias wings spread out to their fullest extent. Then they disappear completely. The cold air around her immediately turns back to normal. Lilias eyes go back to their usual bright green. The two crows on the tree take flight, not accepting any of the offerings. For a moment Lilia doesn’t move, then she drops to her knees. She covers her face in her hands, “I failed… it didn’t work.” She looks at everyone with the most heartbroken expression, her eyes filling with tears that she is trying to hold back. “I’m sorry.”","created_at":"2020-08-17T09:04:35.163000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744844113375133747","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
